Title: Scan panels are titled with the product name, and paths name the brand's folders
Why: The start, live-status and final-report panels were titled STRIX; the Output line and sandbox-image error printed hard-coded strix_runs/ and ~/.strix paths.
Upstream-PR: none

diff --git a/strix/interface/cli.py b/strix/interface/cli.py
index a8992ce4980a2d8c7635d6eca0ef4ff1c90b0782..dbe5306748a3a7db02ff34f11f5f4a8da7ae854b 100644
--- a/strix/interface/cli.py
+++ b/strix/interface/cli.py
